@title New project from the 3D workspace shows the schematic, not the greyed 3D tab
@area Workspaces
# Click test C-04: Ctrl+N while 3D is shown left the new project on the greyed 3D tab ("Set a mounting plate in the Cabinet to see it in 3D"). The new project has no plate, so the schematic shows.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
expect "Open door"
key ctrl+n
wait 25
shot after-ctrl-n
expect_not "Set a mounting plate in the Cabinet"
expect "Press Q to place a symbol"
check_layout
